	quest.1B609EB915C9B813.quest_desc: [
		"Buy it from a master cleric"
		""
		"A holy talisman said to protect its owner from bad luck"
	]
	quest.1C4D9192472ACC3F.quest_desc: [
		"The portal can be assembles in any shape and size you want, the image above is just the minimum size requirement and the portal can be made in many different shapes and sizes. "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The portal functions as long as the following conditions are met:"
		"1.)   The frame is made out of Grass, Dirt, Podzol, Mycelium, etc."
		"2.)   On top of the grass are flowers, mushrooms, leaves, plants, etc."
		"3.)   The frame must be completely filled with water."
	]
	quest.1D08E40F37CA63B7.quest_desc: ["Get the Mysterious Worm by Putting a crimson mosquito larva inside a capsid"]
	quest.1D244505FBDF461D.quest_desc: ["Allows setting up a simple trading machine with one trade. Items can be inserted or extracted on the configured sides."]
	quest.1D8090835DE90CDB.quest_desc: [
		"Exploration is the main focus of End Remastered, and to reach the End and beat the Ender Dragon, you will have to find 16 custom eyes by exploring vanilla structures and fighting vanilla bosses. Once you have at least &l12&r eyes, you can follow them until you reach the Stronghold. You have to put the &l12&r custom eyes in the portal in order to open it. If there's a vanilla eye of ender in one of the frames, you can remove it by right clicking on it with a custom eye."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The Eyes are a really important part of End Remastered, just like Vanilla Ender Eyes, they allow you to activate the portal to the End. However, unlike Vanilla Ender Eyes, they are not dropped by Endermen, but must be found by exploring, fighting and mining."
	]
	quest.1DBE70C472B3237C.quest_desc: ["Give your self a lot of effects with a gem of promise in off hand"]
	quest.1E1AC78F100BE5BF.quest_desc: ["+4 armor"]
	quest.1E54ADB365BD7C51.quest_desc: [
		"The otherside portal is the entrypoint to the Otherside. It follows the same shape as the nether portal, but has a minimum height of 2 instead of 3 by default, along with being composed of reinforced deepslate. Unlit otherside portals can be found in the center of an ancient city and in ancient temples."
		""
		"The otherside portal is opened with a heart of the deep instead of a flint and steel."
	]
	quest.1E5F7443C78E0138.quest_desc: ["Craft the Eye of Mech used to find the Harbinger"]
