	quest.2A41A270337B08E2.quest_desc: ["The End is a space-like dimension with floating end stone islands, accessible with an end portal. It is typically considered the opposite of the Nether. The End is a barren environment, but it is the only place where some of the most unique and useful items in the game can be obtained, such as the elytra or shulker boxes."]
