	quest.2CFAFA19D117B69E.quest_desc: [
		"Overview"
		"Precasia is a tier 1 dimension."
		""
		"Accessing"
		"Precasia is accessed by using a Precasia Realmstone Precasia Realmstone on a carved rune of power in a portal. The realmstone is obtained with archaeology - Advent of Ascension makes it so small patches of Suspicious Gravel will uncommonly generate on the surface of jungle-type biomes in the Overworld. These patches of Suspicious Gravel have a chance to give the realmstone when brushed."
	]
