	quest.49D114932D0B996B.quest_desc: ["Read the Twilight Forest chapter for more info..."]
	quest.49DC62A750ED8B71.quest_desc: [
		"In the shadowy realm of Nocturnus, where twilight eternally blankets the land, there exists a dark mage whose name whispers fear into the hearts of even the bravest souls."
		""
		"Ravenlocke, once an esteemed scholar of the arcane, was consumed by an insatiable thirst for forbidden knowledge. His journey into the depths of darkness began with a single forbidden tome—The Grimoire of Umbral Secrets. As he delved deeper into its pages, Ravenlocke unlocked arcane secrets long forgotten, drawing power from the very essence of shadow itself."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Ravenlocke’s ultimate goal was the mastery of Necromancy, the darkest of arts. He sought to raise an army of the undead, bound to his will, to reign over Nocturnus and beyond. But his ambition did not stop there. Legends spoke of an ancient prophecy, foretelling the rise of a dark mage who would transcend mortality and become a deity of darkness. Ravenlocke believed himself to be the prophesied one and pursued this destiny with relentless determination..."
	]
	quest.49DC62A750ED8B71.quest_subtitle: "The Dark Mage"
